+# Perf history
+
+## Real transcript ingest
+
+No measured figures are available for this project's own real Claude Code
+transcript. I could not find any recorded ingest run (size, turn/episode
+counts, or elapsed time) in this checkout, and this session is sandboxed to
+the working directory, so it cannot read `~/.claude/projects/**/*.jsonl` to
+run the ingest and measure it directly. The only related code found is the
+`parses_real_transcripts_when_present` smoke test in
+`crates/muninn-capture/src/lib.rs`, which prints turn/episode/tool counts
+when such a transcript is present on the machine running it, but its output
+is not captured or stored anywhere in this repo.
+
+This section should be filled in with actual measured numbers (transcript
+size in MB, turn count, episode count, ingest duration) the next time the
+real-transcript smoke test or an equivalent ingest run is executed with its
+output recorded.
